# The suppletive phrases CLDR gives for the period just past: "l-oħra" (the
# other) for the year, "li għadda" for the masculine month and for a weekday,
# "li għaddiet" for the feminine week.  All trail the noun.  Unicode CLDR 47,
# mt dateFields.json, relative-type--1.
l-oħra
li għadda
li għaddiet
